[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0010","text":"哇……\n这个味道，难道是……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0020","text":"是醋饭吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0030","text":"！\n千雪姐……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0040","text":"……啊～……没赶上～\n本来打算在千雪姐来之前完成的～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0050","text":"诶，是这样吗？\n抱歉……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0060","text":"嘿嘿……甜花和奈酱……\n想给千雪姐，一个惊喜……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0070","text":"想办一个……手卷寿司派对……\n来着……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0080","text":"──不过，既然都这样了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0090","text":"就让千雪姐也来帮忙准备派对吧☆"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0100","text":"……！\n当然，我会干劲满满地帮忙的♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600200_04_0101","text":"Motion"}]
